# Run commands automatically

In this repo, **never ask the user to run pnpm, ingest, install, migrate, or similar shell commands**. Execute them yourself via the Shell tool.

- Prefer running `pnpm` scripts (`pnpm ingest:backfill-images`, `pnpm typecheck`, installs, etc.) directly.
- Do not paste "run this yourself" command blocks as the primary action when you can execute them.
- Only surface commands in the reply as a short record of what you already ran, or when a step truly requires interactive human auth (e.g. browser login).
